<English>:
{name}, congratulations! You have received a special pack which contains:

- 7 days of premium account;
- Premium tank T-26 (1st Gv.T.Br.), premium aircraft I-153-M62 Zhukovsky and premium boat G-5 (ShVAK);
- 620000 Silver Lions;
- Equipment for rent for 7 days: Pz.III N, StuH 42 G and Sd.Kfz.234/2;
- 10 backups for each of the tanks of rented;
- 50% discount for 14 days on premium Pz.III N;
- Special boosters: 50% for silver, 50% for research points;

Boosters will be available after 5 battles.

